*.tar.gz

# ============================================================================
# KEEP THESE ESSENTIAL FILES
# ============================================================================
# !worker.js                    - Main Cloudflare Worker (REQUIRED)
# !wrangler.toml                - Cloudflare configuration (REQUIRED)  
# !QUICKSTART.md                - Quick deployment guide
# !README.md                    - Project documentation
# !package.json                 - Optional npm config
# !test-cloudflare-endpoints.sh - Testing script
# !deploy-to-cloudflare-workers.sh - Deployment automation
